(6467442, 961286, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is Epic ! I love the sepia tones, and how you made it look golden, I''m faving this, and giving you a 10. My pick for a ribbon.</td>', 'This is Epic ! I love the sepia tones, and how you made it look golden, I''m faving this, and giving you a 10. My pick for a ribbon.', '2011-07-11 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467447, 960923, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but the kayaker doesn''t seem to be that far away.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but the kayaker doesn''t seem to be that far away.', '2011-07-11 01:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467458, 961396, 35545, '<td valign="top">Very clever execution.</td>', 'Very clever execution.', '2011-07-11 01:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467465, 961254, 28742, '<td valign="top">I rarely deduct for borders, but in this case, the border is close to, or more than 50% of the whole image and for no good reason. Otherwise, the photo itself looks very painterly - like an artistic filter applied. Not that I don''t like the effect, but I don''t know if it helps this image either.</td>', 'I rarely deduct for borders, but in this case, the border is close to, or more than 50% of the whole image and for no good reason. Otherwise, the photo itself looks very painterly - like an artistic filter applied. Not that I don''t like the effect, but I don''t know if it helps this image either.', '2011-07-11 02:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467467, 961213, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well this will place highly simply for it''s historic significance (as I think it should). A great capture as well, though.</td>', 'Well this will place highly simply for it''s historic significance (as I think it should). A great capture as well, though.', '2011-07-11 02:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467468, 960787, 28742, '<td valign="top">The pose / staging / composition are just very unflattering, IMO.</td>', 'The pose / staging / composition are just very unflattering, IMO.', '2011-07-11 02:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467469, 961427, 28742, '<td valign="top">Bit of a fail on the choice of selective desat, IMO, and not to be harsh, but there''s just not much to like about this image.</td>', 'Bit of a fail on the choice of selective desat, IMO, and not to be harsh, but there''s just not much to like about this image.', '2011-07-11 02:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467471, 960350, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Wondering if bw wouldn''t have served this better. Good job, though.</td>', 'Very cool. Wondering if bw wouldn''t have served this better. Good job, though.', '2011-07-11 02:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467476, 961201, 28742, '<td valign="top">The selective desat here is killing an otherwise excellent image. :/</td>', 'The selective desat here is killing an otherwise excellent image. :/', '2011-07-11 02:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467479, 960894, 123833, '<td valign="top">I like this scene but find the colors too saturated. I also think including the bare light patch in front spoils the balance and makes it too busy. Getting a bit closer would make it still OK for the challenge but result in a better balanced image.</td>', 'I like this scene but find the colors too saturated. I also think including the bare light patch in front spoils the balance and makes it too busy. Getting a bit closer would make it still OK for the challenge but result in a better balanced image.', '2011-07-11 02:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467483, 961338, 123833, '<td valign="top">It is a fantastic image, beautifully balanced. I like the 3 fishermen and the green vegetation reflecting in the water. It creates wonderful textures. To top of that the yellows and greens work so well. I can''t give it anything else but 10. A great image.</td>', 'It is a fantastic image, beautifully balanced. I like the 3 fishermen and the green vegetation reflecting in the water. It creates wonderful textures. To top of that the yellows and greens work so well. I can''t give it anything else but 10. A great image.', '2011-07-11 02:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467490, 961405, 123833, '<td valign="top">It is a fascinating sky but the image does not quite work to me. Adding a shadow of an observer would turn it into much more powerful image and inspire greater appreciation and connection with the viewer. It is amazing how many stars are out there!</td>', 'It is a fascinating sky but the image does not quite work to me. Adding a shadow of an observer would turn it into much more powerful image and inspire greater appreciation and connection with the viewer. It is amazing how many stars are out there!', '2011-07-11 02:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467494, 961164, 123833, '<td valign="top">My first impression was that this image is over saturated but in this particular image it looks OK. The simplicity of the composition is great but not particularly original. The sky adds a lot of interest. Overall a nice image but short of being great. Maybe overlaying short exposure of the boat over the long exposure with smoothed out waves would turn a nice image into a great image.</td>', 'My first impression was that this image is over saturated but in this particular image it looks OK. The simplicity of the composition is great but not particularly original. The sky adds a lot of interest. Overall a nice image but short of being great. Maybe overlaying short exposure of the boat over the long exposure with smoothed out waves would turn a nice image into a great image.', '2011-07-11 02:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467497, 961449, 123833, '<td valign="top">A difficult shot through a window of a plane I assume. There seems to be some kind of reflection in the upper center. The color are over saturated and there is a purple vignette around the edges. I thought at first to try B&amp;W but there isn''t enough tone variations to make it work. Nice idea but difficult to make it work.</td>', 'A difficult shot through a window of a plane I assume. There seems to be some kind of reflection in the upper center. The color are over saturated and there is a purple vignette around the edges. I thought at first to try B&W but there isn''t enough tone variations to make it work. Nice idea but difficult to make it work.', '2011-07-11 02:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467505, 961319, 123833, '<td valign="top">This must have been taken from far away to get such DOF in front and back.</td>', 'This must have been taken from far away to get such DOF in front and back.', '2011-07-11 03:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467506, 961213, 60862, '<td valign="top">AWESOME! <br/>Just fantastic timing on the pressure vapor clouds, and beautiful composition and color.</td>', 'AWESOME! Just fantastic timing on the pressure vapor clouds, and beautiful composition and color.', '2011-07-11 03:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467507, 960923, 123833, '<td valign="top">A familiar scene for this challenge - a boat on the water. The toning is nice and warm, and the paddle was just at the right spot to add interest, including the weed attachment. The distant shore adds to the layering effect and probably could have worked better without the glimpses of the sky. A nice serene mood.</td>', 'A familiar scene for this challenge - a boat on the water. The toning is nice and warm, and the paddle was just at the right spot to add interest, including the weed attachment. The distant shore adds to the layering effect and probably could have worked better without the glimpses of the sky. A nice serene mood.', '2011-07-11 03:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467508, 960375, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oops, thought you were going to enter the color one!  Stunning image nonetheless (although this is one of those rare cases I like the color better).</td>', 'Oops, thought you were going to enter the color one!  Stunning image nonetheless (although this is one of those rare cases I like the color better).', '2011-07-11 03:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467510, 960623, 96751, '<td valign="top">Super clarity.  Very cool capture.</td>', 'Super clarity.  Very cool capture.', '2011-07-11 03:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467511, 961439, 123833, '<td valign="top">It looks like a perfect entry for High Key challenge! While I am not a border hater in this case I think a narrow white border could have worked better.</td>', 'It looks like a perfect entry for High Key challenge! While I am not a border hater in this case I think a narrow white border could have worked better.', '2011-07-11 03:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467519, 961172, 131264, '<td valign="top">Nice motif, I like technical structures. I would have cropped the picture on the bottom a bit</td>', 'Nice motif, I like technical structures. I would have cropped the picture on the bottom a bit', '2011-07-11 04:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
