(6467573, 961375, 106484, '<td valign="top">The greens are quite a bit underexposed. Was this shot in raw? Perhaps it could have been corrected.</td>', 'The greens are quite a bit underexposed. Was this shot in raw? Perhaps it could have been corrected.', '2011-07-11 08:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
