(6467650, 961408, 19825, '<td valign="top">I like the image, <strike>but I might have tried cropping not quite so tight or coaxing a bit more detail out of the tire.</strike> Scratch that. I checked it on another better calibrated monitor and the tires is more obviously a tire.</td>', 'I like the image, but I might have tried cropping not quite so tight or coaxing a bit more detail out of the tire. Scratch that. I checked it on another better calibrated monitor and the tires is more obviously a tire.', '2011-07-11 10:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467665, 961078, 10785, '<td valign="top">@<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54033" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">HighNooner</a> - I really like the scene. It has a lot going an and really pulls you in. The blue tones to me suggest changing the white balance to get the colors you got in this photo.</td>', '@ HighNooner - I really like the scene. It has a lot going an and really pulls you in. The blue tones to me suggest changing the white balance to get the colors you got in this photo.', '2011-07-11 11:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467666, 961323, 10785, '<td valign="top">That tower looks like one really cool SLR lens!! I''ll bet it''s made by Canon!</td>', 'That tower looks like one really cool SLR lens!! I''ll bet it''s made by Canon!', '2011-07-11 11:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
