(6467713, 960583, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love it. I might''ve made that moon colored border a bit less saturated (maybe diminish by about 40% or so) but that is just a nitpick. 7</td>', 'I love it. I might''ve made that moon colored border a bit less saturated (maybe diminish by about 40% or so) but that is just a nitpick. 7', '2011-07-11 12:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
