(6467717, 961435, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lensbaby?  I like that the person has on a red shirt so it pulls our eye to him/her.</td>', 'Lensbaby?  I like that the person has on a red shirt so it pulls our eye to him/her.', '2011-07-11 12:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
