(6467720, 961354, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like that they are in white yet they aren''t distracting away from the view.</td>', 'Nice.  I like that they are in white yet they aren''t distracting away from the view.', '2011-07-11 12:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
