(6467723, 961286, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent feel to this one, sepia was a good choice; the composition is a bit "dark heavy" to the left, although the vignetting takes care of that a bit.</td>', 'Excellent feel to this one, sepia was a good choice; the composition is a bit "dark heavy" to the left, although the vignetting takes care of that a bit.', '2011-07-11 12:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
