(6467725, 961300, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is the exact image I envisioned in my head.  It is wonderful.  Love the centered tree.  This might be cool in a sepia as well. :)  Nice going. You managed to pull off what I was thinking.  You get an extra point for clairvoyance. LOL It''s my fav after a 2nd sweep.  Ok, 10 :)</td>', 'This is the exact image I envisioned in my head.  It is wonderful.  Love the centered tree.  This might be cool in a sepia as well. :)  Nice going. You managed to pull off what I was thinking.  You get an extra point for clairvoyance. LOL It''s my fav after a 2nd sweep.  Ok, 10 :)', '2011-07-11 12:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467726, 961286, 15711, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  My favorite so far.  It certainly has a sense of nostalgia. :) After a 2nd sweep, gets a 9 from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  My favorite so far.  It certainly has a sense of nostalgia. :) After a 2nd sweep, gets a 9 from me.', '2011-07-11 12:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
