(6467869, 961286, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the processing of this image really helps to concentrate the eyes on the subject.</td>', 'I like how the processing of this image really helps to concentrate the eyes on the subject.', '2011-07-11 15:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467870, 961307, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject. I have to wonder if you are getting low votes due to the most stand-out subject material is the closest.</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject. I have to wonder if you are getting low votes due to the most stand-out subject material is the closest.', '2011-07-11 15:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467871, 961454, 114225, '<td valign="top">Always fun to catch lightning, but to do well, you need more interest (either in the lightning or the surroundings. Having much of the lightning covered up by the building and trees is realyl hurting.</td>', 'Always fun to catch lightning, but to do well, you need more interest (either in the lightning or the surroundings. Having much of the lightning covered up by the building and trees is realyl hurting.', '2011-07-11 15:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467873, 961396, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very creative technique. It''s interesting how there is that one spot of green bokeh in the upper right of the mirror/lens/whatever that is.</td>', 'Very creative technique. It''s interesting how there is that one spot of green bokeh in the upper right of the mirror/lens/whatever that is.', '2011-07-11 15:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467874, 960883, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very minimalistic approach to the challenge. Fits the requirements well, but I''m not feeling much of a connection to this photo.</td>', 'Very minimalistic approach to the challenge. Fits the requirements well, but I''m not feeling much of a connection to this photo.', '2011-07-11 15:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467875, 961375, 114225, '<td valign="top">A photo like this really takes the viewer''s eyes away from your intended subject. That grass in the foreground and the bright white clouds in the distant background are what my eyes went to first, then finally the tree.</td>', 'A photo like this really takes the viewer''s eyes away from your intended subject. That grass in the foreground and the bright white clouds in the distant background are what my eyes went to first, then finally the tree.', '2011-07-11 15:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467876, 961192, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge, and very cool photo in general. I''m glad you go people in the scene to show the sense of scale.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge, and very cool photo in general. I''m glad you go people in the scene to show the sense of scale.', '2011-07-11 15:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467877, 961444, 114225, '<td valign="top">Creative title, and a nice perspective to enhance the title. I''m not really getting a lot out of this photo.</td>', 'Creative title, and a nice perspective to enhance the title. I''m not really getting a lot out of this photo.', '2011-07-11 15:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467878, 960810, 114225, '<td valign="top">Creative entry for the challenge. I believe she is very unmatched with just having a handgun. One thing to note, the blue spot under the cross hairs is really distracting me.</td>', 'Creative entry for the challenge. I believe she is very unmatched with just having a handgun. One thing to note, the blue spot under the cross hairs is really distracting me.', '2011-07-11 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467879, 961296, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of leading lines and curves to accentuate the architecture.</td>', 'Great use of leading lines and curves to accentuate the architecture.', '2011-07-11 15:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467880, 961354, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like how the littlest girl is looking to her mom for guidance and support. Those white dresses are really great for drawing the eyes in.</td>', 'I really like how the littlest girl is looking to her mom for guidance and support. Those white dresses are really great for drawing the eyes in.', '2011-07-11 15:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467882, 961359, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of silhouette, especially the horn. that bit of light between the horn and head really add a lot to this photo in my opinion (a great test would be painting that spot black in Photoshop and seeing the difference).</td>', 'Great use of silhouette, especially the horn. that bit of light between the horn and head really add a lot to this photo in my opinion (a great test would be painting that spot black in Photoshop and seeing the difference).', '2011-07-11 15:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467883, 961155, 114225, '<td valign="top">This type of photo never ceases to be cool. But the texture of the floor and steps adds to that even more here.</td>', 'This type of photo never ceases to be cool. But the texture of the floor and steps adds to that even more here.', '2011-07-11 15:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467886, 961229, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of color cast. I''m not sure I have ever seen a purple moon before.</td>', 'Interesting choice of color cast. I''m not sure I have ever seen a purple moon before.', '2011-07-11 15:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467887, 961405, 56978, '<td valign="top">I was waiting for an astrophoto to come up.  Good job.  Is this tracked or just high ISO?</td>', 'I was waiting for an astrophoto to come up.  Good job.  Is this tracked or just high ISO?', '2011-07-11 15:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467895, 961347, 114225, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the trombone are what really make this interesting. They are tell the tale that you are indeed far away, but I''m wondering how many people will miss that.</td>', 'The reflections in the trombone are what really make this interesting. They are tell the tale that you are indeed far away, but I''m wondering how many people will miss that.', '2011-07-11 15:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467897, 961265, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very very cool. That emerald green really flows and creates a peaceful feeling.</td>', 'Very very cool. That emerald green really flows and creates a peaceful feeling.', '2011-07-11 15:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467898, 961254, 114225, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I''m finding the processing of this to be very distracting. In fact, the processing seems to be nearly hiding the plane from view.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I''m finding the processing of this to be very distracting. In fact, the processing seems to be nearly hiding the plane from view.', '2011-07-11 15:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467899, 961368, 114225, '<td valign="top">A very cool series of waterfalls indeed. However, it feels like you are very very close to the foreground which seems to be as much of the subject as the background.<br/> <br/>Also note that your photo is slightly tilted to the left.</td>', 'A very cool series of waterfalls indeed. However, it feels like you are very very close to the foreground which seems to be as much of the subject as the background. Also note that your photo is slightly tilted to the left.', '2011-07-11 15:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467900, 961114, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely view with nice calm colors of the rising sun. The photo has a very serene feel to it.</td>', 'Lovely view with nice calm colors of the rising sun. The photo has a very serene feel to it.', '2011-07-11 15:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467904, 961205, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool view. I like the different levels of distance used in this photo. One thing that is distracting me a little bit is the halo effect around the tree.</td>', 'Very cool view. I like the different levels of distance used in this photo. One thing that is distracting me a little bit is the halo effect around the tree.', '2011-07-11 15:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467905, 961190, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition of the different objects in this photo, especially the lining up of the plane and buoy.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition of the different objects in this photo, especially the lining up of the plane and buoy.', '2011-07-11 15:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467906, 960799, 56978, '<td valign="top">Slightly dubious about whether it meets the challenge, but nice shot nonetheless...</td>', 'Slightly dubious about whether it meets the challenge, but nice shot nonetheless...', '2011-07-11 15:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467907, 961511, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of sky, light, and shadows. Normally I don''t mind borders, but I''m really disappointed by this one due to cutting off so much of this beautiful scene.</td>', 'Lovely use of sky, light, and shadows. Normally I don''t mind borders, but I''m really disappointed by this one due to cutting off so much of this beautiful scene.', '2011-07-11 15:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467908, 961133, 114225, '<td valign="top">The clouds add a lot of interest and movement to the image, but the processing feels a bit harsh on my eyes.</td>', 'The clouds add a lot of interest and movement to the image, but the processing feels a bit harsh on my eyes.', '2011-07-11 15:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467909, 961396, 56978, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Even if I don''t quite know what ''it'' is.</td>', 'I like it.  Even if I don''t quite know what ''it'' is.', '2011-07-11 15:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467910, 960583, 56978, '<td valign="top">Nice bit of Earthshine you got there</td>', 'Nice bit of Earthshine you got there', '2011-07-11 15:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467914, 961323, 56978, '<td valign="top">Cripes I can see my office from that shot...who''s been lurking around there then??</td>', 'Cripes I can see my office from that shot...who''s been lurking around there then??', '2011-07-11 16:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
