(6468379, 960375, 124190, '<td valign="top">great vertical shot....sense of distance.....good in black and white...ya I''ve often looked at planes and it''s odd to think there are people inside who have lofty ideas and demanding personalities along with issues, anxieties, joys, hopes, dreams, babies, lovers etc......they seem insignificant from so far away....wish alot would disappear with a plane like that!   MOTHER NATURE IN HER FINEST....GREAT SHOT!</td>', 'great vertical shot....sense of distance.....good in black and white...ya I''ve often looked at planes and it''s odd to think there are people inside who have lofty ideas and demanding personalities along with issues, anxieties, joys, hopes, dreams, babies, lovers etc......they seem insignificant from so far away....wish alot would disappear with a plane like that!   MOTHER NATURE IN HER FINEST....GREAT SHOT!', '2011-07-12 13:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
