(6469710, 961254, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the painted appearance of the clouds, but I might suggest lessening that effect on the plane itself, even possibly eliminating it. Without the title, it is hard to tell it''s a plane.</td>', 'I like the painted appearance of the clouds, but I might suggest lessening that effect on the plane itself, even possibly eliminating it. Without the title, it is hard to tell it''s a plane.', '2011-07-13 15:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
