(6469741, 961502, 123833, '<td valign="top">I assume the grain is intentional. It doesn''t quite work for me but I am not clear why.</td>', 'I assume the grain is intentional. It doesn''t quite work for me but I am not clear why.', '2011-07-13 16:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469769, 961279, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really like the subject, and the reflected sun adds a bit of extra coolness. I''m not sure how I feel about the simplified painted look. That works well in movies, but as a photograph it''s hard to pull off.</td>', 'Really like the subject, and the reflected sun adds a bit of extra coolness. I''m not sure how I feel about the simplified painted look. That works well in movies, but as a photograph it''s hard to pull off.', '2011-07-13 16:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469771, 961412, 114225, '<td valign="top">Definitely a far away subject, but what this photo lacks for me is interest. The geese start to add that, but the sky overwhelms everything and makes the boats/geese seem like sidekicks where they could have been the main attraction.</td>', 'Definitely a far away subject, but what this photo lacks for me is interest. The geese start to add that, but the sky overwhelms everything and makes the boats/geese seem like sidekicks where they could have been the main attraction.', '2011-07-13 16:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469772, 961197, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, is that a giant ship they are next to? I''m certainly wishing there was more clarity in this shot.</td>', 'Cute shot, is that a giant ship they are next to? I''m certainly wishing there was more clarity in this shot.', '2011-07-13 16:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469775, 961391, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this scene overall, but especially how the waves are breaking in with the shadows cast by the setting sun. It all plays together quite nicely.</td>', 'I really enjoy this scene overall, but especially how the waves are breaking in with the shadows cast by the setting sun. It all plays together quite nicely.', '2011-07-13 16:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469776, 960738, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo, as the girl on the bike actually seemed to become the subject to this photo instead of the power station. I think it''s the pink pants that stick out among the washed out colors. I think this could have been more powerful if you were on the other side of the path.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo, as the girl on the bike actually seemed to become the subject to this photo instead of the power station. I think it''s the pink pants that stick out among the washed out colors. I think this could have been more powerful if you were on the other side of the path.', '2011-07-13 16:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469777, 961379, 114225, '<td valign="top">Definitely a far away subject, and nice details in the craters. But this photo has been taken a million times, so for me, it''s lacking the interest that I''m looking for.</td>', 'Definitely a far away subject, and nice details in the craters. But this photo has been taken a million times, so for me, it''s lacking the interest that I''m looking for.', '2011-07-13 16:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469779, 961213, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great salute to the final launch. I''m guessing you had to de-noise this quite heavily which is why the shuttle looks soft? If that were a tad bit sharper, this could have been much more powerful. Still good.</td>', 'Great salute to the final launch. I''m guessing you had to de-noise this quite heavily which is why the shuttle looks soft? If that were a tad bit sharper, this could have been much more powerful. Still good.', '2011-07-13 17:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469824, 961229, 135204, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the blue glow around the moon adds anything to the shot.</td>', 'I don''t think the blue glow around the moon adds anything to the shot.', '2011-07-13 18:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
