(6469867, 961334, 135204, '<td valign="top">Really gives a feeling of distance.</td>', 'Really gives a feeling of distance.', '2011-07-13 20:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469869, 961300, 135204, '<td valign="top">The lines leading to the tree give a feeling of distance.  Well done.</td>', 'The lines leading to the tree give a feeling of distance.  Well done.', '2011-07-13 20:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469906, 961466, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think a little more diamond and a little less sky may have made a better composition, shifting the camera view a little to the left and down a hair. But certainly you have great color and a dynamic image!</td>', 'I think a little more diamond and a little less sky may have made a better composition, shifting the camera view a little to the left and down a hair. But certainly you have great color and a dynamic image!', '2011-07-13 21:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469908, 961347, 10785, '<td valign="top">What great color!! You put that blowhole right smack in the center too!! I do think that the far away or from a distance concept was a little lost because you used a telephoto lens to bring the distance close to the viewer.</td>', 'What great color!! You put that blowhole right smack in the center too!! I do think that the far away or from a distance concept was a little lost because you used a telephoto lens to bring the distance close to the viewer.', '2011-07-13 21:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469910, 961379, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a distant object. I think the concept of the challenge was a little lost due to the fact you brought the distant image close to the viewer with a telephoto lens. But certainly it is not DNMC. A great moon!</td>', 'This is definitely a distant object. I think the concept of the challenge was a little lost due to the fact you brought the distant image close to the viewer with a telephoto lens. But certainly it is not DNMC. A great moon!', '2011-07-13 21:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469911, 961375, 10785, '<td valign="top">I love tree shots and I think you did good here. You got the right angle and perspective on the tree. It is a hair off of rule of thirds for composition which detracts. You are also running into the same problem I have around here... lone trees in the field with a tree line in the background. The best solitary tree shots are shot with a very bare background and great sky!</td>', 'I love tree shots and I think you did good here. You got the right angle and perspective on the tree. It is a hair off of rule of thirds for composition which detracts. You are also running into the same problem I have around here... lone trees in the field with a tree line in the background. The best solitary tree shots are shot with a very bare background and great sky!', '2011-07-13 21:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469920, 960787, 131284, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I feel entering this in a challenge entitled "from a distance" is a little dubious, since the focus is on the women near by, however I do really love the photo! Based on photographic merit alone this is by far my favourite image in the competition. I guess this does just about fit the rules though so I''ve still given it an 8, which is my joint highest score. Perhaps if I didn''t like the image so much I''d have been less flexible.</td>', 'Hmm, I feel entering this in a challenge entitled "from a distance" is a little dubious, since the focus is on the women near by, however I do really love the photo! Based on photographic merit alone this is by far my favourite image in the competition. I guess this does just about fit the rules though so I''ve still given it an 8, which is my joint highest score. Perhaps if I didn''t like the image so much I''d have been less flexible.', '2011-07-13 21:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469968, 961510, 125275, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem far away, but DMNC aside, the subject is not in focus. Well, two of its legs are, but I''m not feeling it''s enough to save this image.</td>', 'This doesn''t seem far away, but DMNC aside, the subject is not in focus. Well, two of its legs are, but I''m not feeling it''s enough to save this image.', '2011-07-13 23:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469970, 960810, 125275, '<td valign="top">Awesome creativity and a very unique entry. I would maybe place the crosshairs a little higher? Crotch shot is not a kill shot. ;-) Still, I like the effect.<br/>Did you shoot this at f/007?</td>', 'Awesome creativity and a very unique entry. I would maybe place the crosshairs a little higher? Crotch shot is not a kill shot. ;-) Still, I like the effect.Did you shoot this at f/007?', '2011-07-13 23:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469980, 961078, 114225, '<td valign="top">I imagine this is the same scene we saw in a challenge recently, but it''s still very cool and the telephoto lens compression certainly gives it a distinct feel.</td>', 'I imagine this is the same scene we saw in a challenge recently, but it''s still very cool and the telephoto lens compression certainly gives it a distinct feel.', '2011-07-13 23:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469982, 961508, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalism. I wonder if you have heard this yet, the bottom of the frame being so out of focus is very distracting. I think cropping that out would have helped a lot.</td>', 'Nice minimalism. I wonder if you have heard this yet, the bottom of the frame being so out of focus is very distracting. I think cropping that out would have helped a lot.', '2011-07-13 23:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469983, 961492, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m very glad you captured this with the person. That bit of movement to this otherwise still scene really stands out.</td>', 'I''m very glad you captured this with the person. That bit of movement to this otherwise still scene really stands out.', '2011-07-13 23:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469984, 961160, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of leading the viewer into the image with the lines created from the posts and the boats. I really like the serene feeling this sky is providing.</td>', 'Good use of leading the viewer into the image with the lines created from the posts and the boats. I really like the serene feeling this sky is providing.', '2011-07-13 23:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469986, 961319, 114225, '<td valign="top">Like mother like daughter. They have the exact same stare in their eyes. Nice use of depth of field to really make your subjects pop.</td>', 'Like mother like daughter. They have the exact same stare in their eyes. Nice use of depth of field to really make your subjects pop.', '2011-07-13 23:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469988, 961460, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene with an interesting mix of colors. FYI, you have a dust spot in the upper right (just above the clouds).</td>', 'Beautiful scene with an interesting mix of colors. FYI, you have a dust spot in the upper right (just above the clouds).', '2011-07-13 23:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469989, 961435, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the story/message behind this photo. The lensbaby effect certainly helps to accentuate the message here.</td>', 'I like the story/message behind this photo. The lensbaby effect certainly helps to accentuate the message here.', '2011-07-13 23:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469991, 961388, 114225, '<td valign="top">These big birds never seem to sit still when you want them to. Of course, the movement here makes this photo 10x better.</td>', 'These big birds never seem to sit still when you want them to. Of course, the movement here makes this photo 10x better.', '2011-07-13 23:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469992, 961505, 114225, '<td valign="top">First time I looked at this (and avoided voting because I wasn''t sure what to say), I missed the people. They add such a grand sense of scale, I''m very glad that you included them.</td>', 'First time I looked at this (and avoided voting because I wasn''t sure what to say), I missed the people. They add such a grand sense of scale, I''m very glad that you included them.', '2011-07-13 23:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469995, 961163, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised nobody is taking advantage of these benches for such a gorgeous moment. Note that I feel like the bench is so over powering here that it takes focus away from the sun and becomes the subject of the photo. If you are getting low votes, that may be one reason.</td>', 'I''m surprised nobody is taking advantage of these benches for such a gorgeous moment. Note that I feel like the bench is so over powering here that it takes focus away from the sun and becomes the subject of the photo. If you are getting low votes, that may be one reason.', '2011-07-13 23:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469997, 961315, 114225, '<td valign="top">A very different view on this challenge. At first, I wasn''t sure what the message was, but as I thought for a second it became clear. Very clever.</td>', 'A very different view on this challenge. At first, I wasn''t sure what the message was, but as I thought for a second it became clear. Very clever.', '2011-07-13 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
