(6470001, 961300, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks like all of his friends left him; lonely indeed. I like the different swatches of colors here.</td>', 'Looks like all of his friends left him; lonely indeed. I like the different swatches of colors here.', '2011-07-13 23:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
