(6470032, 960350, 114225, '<td valign="top">I can only imagine that son''t last long. One thing you will want to watch out for in your photos that is easy to fix is chromatic aberration. Zoom in on an area at the top of the tree and you can easily see the bright purples/greens. That is chromatic aberration.</td>', 'I can only imagine that son''t last long. One thing you will want to watch out for in your photos that is easy to fix is chromatic aberration. Zoom in on an area at the top of the tree and you can easily see the bright purples/greens. That is chromatic aberration.', '2011-07-13 23:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
