(6470523, 961388, 69034, '<td valign="top">My number one rule on DPC when it comes to challenges is that if I have to explain myself in the title, then it is not the shot I should be entering.  On the bright side, I love the deep green syou picked up in the shot.</td>', 'My number one rule on DPC when it comes to challenges is that if I have to explain myself in the title, then it is not the shot I should be entering.  On the bright side, I love the deep green syou picked up in the shot.', '2011-07-14 15:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6470525, 961251, 69034, '<td valign="top">I am a big proponent of humorous photos on the site, but, unfortunately they often get clumped in with the erotic/abstract photos in the people don''t like them category.  I however, find this awesome, though some might argue it is not quite within parameters.  Thumbs up!</td>', 'I am a big proponent of humorous photos on the site, but, unfortunately they often get clumped in with the erotic/abstract photos in the people don''t like them category.  I however, find this awesome, though some might argue it is not quite within parameters.  Thumbs up!', '2011-07-14 15:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6470526, 960894, 126709, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and contrast between the water and sky.  I like the hint of the lighthouse in the distance.  Just wonder if another angle was possible to eliminate the blown out sand in the foreground.  Still a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Beautiful color and contrast between the water and sky.  I like the hint of the lighthouse in the distance.  Just wonder if another angle was possible to eliminate the blown out sand in the foreground.  Still a beautiful photo.', '2011-07-14 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
