(6470530, 960810, 69034, '<td valign="top">It looks like the sniper is trying to shoot her vagina. . . .  That and other elements do not make the composition work well for me.  Fun idea, though.</td>', 'It looks like the sniper is trying to shoot her vagina. . . .  That and other elements do not make the composition work well for me.  Fun idea, though.', '2011-07-14 15:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
