(6471609, 961213, 11769, '<td valign="top">gorgeous shot. I grew up on the Mercury, Gemini, Apollo missions and when the Shuttle came along it was a dream come true. We envisioned building the Space Station, going back to the Moon and setting up a base. Then about now we would be reaching for Mars.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the wonderful photograph.</td>', 'gorgeous shot. I grew up on the Mercury, Gemini, Apollo missions and when the Shuttle came along it was a dream come true. We envisioned building the Space Station, going back to the Moon and setting up a base. Then about now we would be reaching for Mars. Thanks for the wonderful photograph.', '2011-07-15 15:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471627, 961507, 125275, '<td valign="top">Wow, is this even real? This an awesome shot and looks like I am actually there. Awesome colors, focus, exposure, everything.</td>', 'Wow, is this even real? This an awesome shot and looks like I am actually there. Awesome colors, focus, exposure, everything.', '2011-07-15 16:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471628, 961136, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very nice and clear. Great shot and nice cropping.</td>', 'Very nice and clear. Great shot and nice cropping.', '2011-07-15 16:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471629, 961006, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and title. Really illustrates the entire concept of distance. The sky, B&amp;W and overall processing works really well. Bumping this up to an 8</td>', 'I like this shot and title. Really illustrates the entire concept of distance. The sky, B&W and overall processing works really well. Bumping this up to an 8', '2011-07-15 16:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471632, 961338, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and clarity. The border is getting a little DPC cliché, and doesn''t particularly add to this photo, but that''s not a dig on the quality of the photo at all. Bumping this to an 8, I really like it more my 2nd time around.</td>', 'Nice colors and clarity. The border is getting a little DPC cliché, and doesn''t particularly add to this photo, but that''s not a dig on the quality of the photo at all. Bumping this to an 8, I really like it more my 2nd time around.', '2011-07-15 16:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471633, 961334, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF with the foreground. It really helps draw the eye down the road and away.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF with the foreground. It really helps draw the eye down the road and away.', '2011-07-15 16:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471637, 961265, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is really nicely done and I''m bumping this from a 7 to a 9. The textures and colors are really working here.</td>', 'This is really nicely done and I''m bumping this from a 7 to a 9. The textures and colors are really working here.', '2011-07-15 16:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6471638, 961511, 63244, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this! It fits the challenge perfectly and the border is a nice choice. Beautifully done.</td>', 'I absolutely love this! It fits the challenge perfectly and the border is a nice choice. Beautifully done.', '2011-07-15 16:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
