(6473358, 961251, 30861, '<td valign="top">Another of those quirky takes that so much appeal to me. Distance is such a relative thing :-) (Just commenting now, finished voting days ago, gave it a 9.)</td>', 'Another of those quirky takes that so much appeal to me. Distance is such a relative thing :-) (Just commenting now, finished voting days ago, gave it a 9.)', '2011-07-17 20:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473363, 961387, 60862, '<td valign="top">Intriguing!  Is the sun below the clouds, creating shadows on their undersides?</td>', 'Intriguing!  Is the sun below the clouds, creating shadows on their undersides?', '2011-07-17 20:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473364, 961254, 60862, '<td valign="top">Why put a landsxape shot into a portrait orientation?  Not working for me.  The image seems to have quite strong JPG artifacts - the sky shouldn''t be choppy like that.  Which is too bad, because the image itself is nice.</td>', 'Why put a landsxape shot into a portrait orientation?  Not working for me.  The image seems to have quite strong JPG artifacts - the sky shouldn''t be choppy like that.  Which is too bad, because the image itself is nice.', '2011-07-17 20:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473368, 961434, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but putting something in the title doesn''t make it the subject.  The subject pretty clearly is the rock and spray.  Aside from that, though, I think the vertical orientation detracts from the power of the water.  A wide view would grab me more.</td>', 'Sorry, but putting something in the title doesn''t make it the subject.  The subject pretty clearly is the rock and spray.  Aside from that, though, I think the vertical orientation detracts from the power of the water.  A wide view would grab me more.', '2011-07-17 20:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473371, 961323, 60862, '<td valign="top">The odd desaturation isn''t working for me.  Which is too bad, because I like the composition otherwise.</td>', 'The odd desaturation isn''t working for me.  Which is too bad, because I like the composition otherwise.', '2011-07-17 20:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473373, 961444, 60862, '<td valign="top">This reminds of a time I was 3 and got lost behind my house.  I was found near a school that had domes like this.</td>', 'This reminds of a time I was 3 and got lost behind my house.  I was found near a school that had domes like this.', '2011-07-17 20:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
