(6473500, 960787, 3102, '<td valign="top">Gotta be Leroy!  :)  I always enjoy your work... you have a great knack for lighting.</td>', 'Gotta be Leroy!  :)  I always enjoy your work... you have a great knack for lighting.', '2011-07-17 21:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473532, 961354, 33068, '<td valign="top">Hi Sjhuls....  :)</td>', 'Hi Sjhuls....  :)', '2011-07-17 22:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473542, 961078, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love all the interlocking shapes and bold yellows.</td>', 'Love all the interlocking shapes and bold yellows.', '2011-07-17 22:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473543, 961327, 76335, '<td valign="top">So happy you didn''t crop this. It''s perfect as is.</td>', 'So happy you didn''t crop this. It''s perfect as is.', '2011-07-17 22:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473545, 961412, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the layers of groups here -- clouds, sails, ducks (?) and plants...</td>', 'I like the layers of groups here -- clouds, sails, ducks (?) and plants...', '2011-07-17 22:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473546, 960738, 76335, '<td valign="top">A wonderful assortment of disparate things here...</td>', 'A wonderful assortment of disparate things here...', '2011-07-17 22:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473547, 961099, 76335, '<td valign="top">Like an illustration from an old encyclopedia. Love the gritty charcoal tones.</td>', 'Like an illustration from an old encyclopedia. Love the gritty charcoal tones.', '2011-07-17 22:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473548, 961254, 102315, '<td valign="top">Waaay too much border</td>', 'Waaay too much border', '2011-07-17 22:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473549, 960876, 135685, '<td valign="top">I really love the way the clouds are illuminated in this photo. When I look at the photo, I feel as if I''m transported to an isolated lake in the middle of Europe! Absolutely love it!</td>', 'I really love the way the clouds are illuminated in this photo. When I look at the photo, I feel as if I''m transported to an isolated lake in the middle of Europe! Absolutely love it!', '2011-07-17 22:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473552, 961006, 76335, '<td valign="top">Perfect.</td>', 'Perfect.', '2011-07-17 22:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473554, 961408, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of framing the distant view through something closer.  But in this case, the tire takes up too much of the frame for me.  It might have worked better to be sure the tire was straight on, to maximize the image area for the distant parts.  Not just because of the challenge, but because that would''ve brought in more detail from far away, making the image more interesting.  Also, if you''re going to frame the subject, I think it usually works best not to have "leakage," meaning the areas at the corners where the background shows through.  Those bright spots distract me from paying attention to the nice primary scene.  All in all, a good effort.  I hope my suggestions help you continue to experiment with the technique!</td>', 'I like the idea of framing the distant view through something closer.  But in this case, the tire takes up too much of the frame for me.  It might have worked better to be sure the tire was straight on, to maximize the image area for the distant parts.  Not just because of the challenge, but because that would''ve brought in more detail from far away, making the image more interesting.  Also, if you''re going to frame the subject, I think it usually works best not to have "leakage," meaning the areas at the corners where the background shows through.  Those bright spots distract me from paying attention to the nice primary scene.  All in all, a good effort.  I hope my suggestions help you continue to experiment with the technique!', '2011-07-17 22:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473555, 960810, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I think I would''ve liked it more if less of the image were black and the frame, and more were her.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I think I would''ve liked it more if less of the image were black and the frame, and more were her.', '2011-07-17 22:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473556, 961390, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting shadows, but I''m not getting a sense they''re more than a few feet away.</td>', 'Interesting shadows, but I''m not getting a sense they''re more than a few feet away.', '2011-07-17 22:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473560, 960350, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow - precarious!</td>', 'Wow - precarious!', '2011-07-17 23:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473561, 960872, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but it seems tilted.  I''d like it better with more contrast, too.  Everything seems a little muted.</td>', 'I like the composition, but it seems tilted.  I''d like it better with more contrast, too.  Everything seems a little muted.', '2011-07-17 23:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473564, 961489, 60862, '<td valign="top">So ... good for you to enter this at DPC.  I don''t mind the grain, the low contrast, or the composition. But it''s just a little too dark for my taste.  I don''t mean I''d make it bright, and I can see all the way to the edges, but overall it strikes me as too dark.  Maybe a little more contrast would''ve brightened at least the center, making it easier to see the subject, while keeping the overall somber feel?</td>', 'So ... good for you to enter this at DPC.  I don''t mind the grain, the low contrast, or the composition. But it''s just a little too dark for my taste.  I don''t mean I''d make it bright, and I can see all the way to the edges, but overall it strikes me as too dark.  Maybe a little more contrast would''ve brightened at least the center, making it easier to see the subject, while keeping the overall somber feel?', '2011-07-17 23:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473567, 960274, 60862, '<td valign="top">This one grabbed my attention for a while.  I''m left feeling like I want to know more and see more.  Is that a ship with a wake, and something else in front of it?  Or is that a rock with waves swirling around it, and a ship beyond it?  So it leaves me feeling dissatisfied.  I''d also like it to be a little brighter.  But if that feeling of wanting more was your goal, you succeeded with this very unsharp, dark, moody image.</td>', 'This one grabbed my attention for a while.  I''m left feeling like I want to know more and see more.  Is that a ship with a wake, and something else in front of it?  Or is that a rock with waves swirling around it, and a ship beyond it?  So it leaves me feeling dissatisfied.  I''d also like it to be a little brighter.  But if that feeling of wanting more was your goal, you succeeded with this very unsharp, dark, moody image.', '2011-07-17 23:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473573, 961488, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this better cropped down to eliminate most of the washed out sky.</td>', 'I think I''d like this better cropped down to eliminate most of the washed out sky.', '2011-07-17 23:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473578, 961354, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I like the choice of having them wear white against the earthy tones.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I like the choice of having them wear white against the earthy tones.', '2011-07-17 23:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473584, 961338, 60862, '<td valign="top">I love the reflections, deep DOF, and composition.  And the colors are wonderful. Back to bump up to a 9.</td>', 'I love the reflections, deep DOF, and composition.  And the colors are wonderful. Back to bump up to a 9.', '2011-07-17 23:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473586, 961300, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really like the leading lines in both the sky and field.  The single tree dead center works very well!  ETA: back to bump to 9.</td>', 'I really like the leading lines in both the sky and field.  The single tree dead center works very well!  ETA: back to bump to 9.', '2011-07-17 23:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473587, 961319, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the deer a lot.  I think I''d like the shot overall better if it were cropped to eliminate most of the stuff to either side of them.  I realize you''re trying to show they''re far away, but it feels off-balance to me.</td>', 'I like the deer a lot.  I think I''d like the shot overall better if it were cropped to eliminate most of the stuff to either side of them.  I realize you''re trying to show they''re far away, but it feels off-balance to me.', '2011-07-17 23:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473588, 961078, 60862, '<td valign="top">Heh - funny title. :)  I really like the rich colors and the contrast of the little bit of the street.</td>', 'Heh - funny title. :)  I really like the rich colors and the contrast of the little bit of the street.', '2011-07-17 23:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473591, 961164, 60862, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, grand sweep, and the composition!</td>', 'Love the colors, grand sweep, and the composition!', '2011-07-17 23:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473592, 961508, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The distant, sharp subject against such nice blues.</td>', 'I really like this.  The distant, sharp subject against such nice blues.', '2011-07-17 23:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473594, 961251, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great, original take on "from a distance!"  Sometimes even a little distance is too much.</td>', 'Great, original take on "from a distance!"  Sometimes even a little distance is too much.', '2011-07-17 23:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473595, 961192, 60862, '<td valign="top">The rich greens and the contrasting bridge are wonderful colors.  I think I''d like it better cropped a little differently, either to show the height of the bridge off the ground or put the bridge low to show the height of the trees towering above it.</td>', 'The rich greens and the contrasting bridge are wonderful colors.  I think I''d like it better cropped a little differently, either to show the height of the bridge off the ground or put the bridge low to show the height of the trees towering above it.', '2011-07-17 23:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473596, 961265, 60862, '<td valign="top">Love the sand formations!</td>', 'Love the sand formations!', '2011-07-17 23:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473597, 961510, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the out-of-the-box thinking here.  Having the legs in focus and the body not gives the perception that the spider''s a good distance away. It also plays on the relative concept of "from a distance," since the photo seems to be from the prey''s point of view.</td>', 'I like the out-of-the-box thinking here.  Having the legs in focus and the body not gives the perception that the spider''s a good distance away. It also plays on the relative concept of "from a distance," since the photo seems to be from the prey''s point of view.', '2011-07-17 23:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473598, 961379, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like how the light/dark line provides such nice contrast and details in the craters.  I also like the square crop.</td>', 'I like how the light/dark line provides such nice contrast and details in the craters.  I also like the square crop.', '2011-07-17 23:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6473601, 960876, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the clouds a lot.  The tones seem muted to me, though.  I wonder what it''d look like with more contrast?</td>', 'I like the composition and the clouds a lot.  The tones seem muted to me, though.  I wonder what it''d look like with more contrast?', '2011-07-17 23:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
