(6474419, 961192, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ytshuva:</b></div><hr/><i> amazing place and great picture.<br/>I''m not sure about the blur effect issue, My last blue was DQL due to small motion blur..yet maybe this kind of filter is ok.. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s not a blur, it''s a glow really.  The effet is called "Glamour Glow" in NIK.  Adding Motion blur is definitely not ok, however Glamour Glow is something completely different and is totally ok.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-18 13:58:49.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by ytshuva: amazing place and great picture.I''m not sure about the blur effect issue, My last blue was DQL due to small motion blur..yet maybe this kind of filter is ok..   It''s not a blur, it''s a glow really.  The effet is called "Glamour Glow" in NIK.  Adding Motion blur is definitely not ok, however Glamour Glow is something completely different and is totally ok.', '2011-07-18 14:58:27.000000', '2011-07-18 14:58:49.000000', 0),
